  "body": "Some `<p>` tags are not closed properly, which causes tools like [cheerio][cheerio] to fail when parsing. I just came across this when I'm trying to split the [source] to facilitate collaboration when [translating][2101].\r\n\r\n> I make two changes, and now cheerio runs happily. Maybe useful to post the changes here.\r\n\r\n[2101]: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2101\r\n[cheerio]: https://github.com/cheeriojs/cheerio\r\n[source]: https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/master/source",
